{
  "firestore": {
    "rules": "firestore.rules",
    "indexes": "firestore.indexes.json"
  },
  "hosting": {
    "public": "public",
    "ignore": [
      "firebase.json",
      "**/.*",
      "**/node_modules/**"
    ],
    "cleanUrls": true,
    "trailingSlash": false,
    "rewrites": [
      {
        "source": "/app/**",
        "destination": "/app.html"
      }
    ],
    "headers": [
      {
        "source": "**/*.@(js|css)",
        "headers": [
          { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache, must-revalidate" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_comment": "Header keamanan dipasang di '**', bukan '**/*.html'. Dengan cleanUrls:true, URL yang benar-benar dilayani adalah '/', '/privasi', '/app' — '/index.html' malah 301 ke '/'. Pola '**/*.html' karena itu TIDAK PERNAH cocok dengan satu permintaan pun di produksi, sehingga nosniff/Referrer-Policy/anti-framing diam-diam tidak aktif. Keempat header ini aman dipasang ke semua respons.",
        "source": "**",
        "headers": [
          { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
          { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" },
          { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "DENY" },
          { "key": "Content-Security-Policy", "value": "frame-ancestors 'none'" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_comment": "Cache-Control dokumen tidak bisa ikut '**' (aset statis justru boleh di-cache), jadi rutenya disebut eksplisit: root, tiap clean URL, dan pola .html untuk akses langsung. Tanpa ini beranda dilayani max-age=3600 — penumpukan cache yang justru ingin dicegah.",
        "source": "/",
        "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache" }]
      },
      {
        "source": "/@(privasi|syarat|refund|app|admin|404)",
        "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache" }]
      },
      {
        "source": "**/*.html",
        "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache" }]
      },
      {
        "source": "/sw.js",
        "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache" }]
      },
      {
        "source": "/version.json",
        "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache, must-revalidate" }]
      }
    ]
  },
  "emulators": {
    "auth": {
      "port": 9099
    },
    "firestore": {
      "port": 8080
    },
    "hosting": {
      "port": 5000
    },
    "ui": {
      "enabled": true
    },
    "singleProjectMode": true
  }
}
